sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Student browser
  participant P as Platform
  participant L as Lab
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  Note over B,D: Provision
  B->>P: Launch instance
  P->>P: seed = 9 random bytes
  P->>L: POST /internal/provision
  L->>L: flag = HMAC(secret, slug:seed)
  L-->>P: sha256(flag)
  P->>D: Store seed, flag_hash
  P-->>B: Lab URL with the seed
  Note over B,D: Exploit
  B->>L: Attack the vulnerable route
  L-->>B: Flag revealed
  Note over B,D: Grade
  B->>P: Submit flag
  P->>P: Check user, sha256(flag)
  P->>D: Compare, insert attempt
  alt hashes match
    P-->>B: Solved, score breakdown
  else no match
    P-->>B: Incorrect
  end
